msgstr "%d soft-body effects enabled: natural sag, belly support, inertia and elastic settling."

msgid "已识别 %d 个眨眼 / 微笑形态键，可在通用动作中使用。"
msgstr "%d blink / smile shape keys detected for generic motion."

msgid "动作风格"
